# PWV Insights

Analytics dashboard for Poudre Wilderness Volunteers (patrol reports, trails, schedules).

## Dev servers (both required locally)

1. `npm run dev:api` — Node dev API on port 3001 (`.env.local` from `.env.example`)
2. `npm run dev` — Vite on port 5173; proxies `/api` to the dev API

## Stack

React 19, Vite 6, TypeScript (strict), Tailwind CSS 4, React Router 7, Leaflet. Prod API is PHP in `php/api/`; schema in `sql/`.

## Code layout

- `src/pages/` — one file per route; owns route-level state
- `src/components/` — feature-scoped; no cross-domain imports
- `src/services/` — all `fetch` to `/api/...`
- `src/contexts/` — `AuthContext` only for global state
- `src/types/` — one file per feature domain

## Quality

No automated tests. Run `npm run lint` after substantive changes. Design tokens in `product-plan/design-system/` (Emerald/Amber/Stone, Inter + JetBrains Mono).
